  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "CPR-015" ;
  triage:title "BA.5 claims the ack path is unchanged; upsert_message_state gained a new CASE branch (doc half: cipher, test half: solar)" ;
  triage:description "Hostile closure review (general-purpose opus, task af4edaf6699568f49) @ 9f5aef2fe. BA.5 claims the ack path is unchanged; upsert_message_state gained a new CASE branch. Doc says: sprint-BA.5: the acknowledgement path is unchanged and clears the marker via the existing upsert. Code does: upsert_message_state gained a new CASE branch as part of the ephemeral-item work, altering the ack path's marker semantics. Recommendation: Amend the sprint doc to describe the new branch and add an ack test that actually acknowledges a message and observes the marker clear. Split: doc half (amend sprint-BA.5 to describe the new branch) owned by cipher on fix/phase-ba-review-1's docs bundle; test half (write an ack test that actually acknowledges a message and observes the marker clear) owned by solar review-3 item B3." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "documentation" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:source "qa" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/task_store.rs" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T07:08:18Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix (ATM 01M2A8G2KREP4HGFCA0MV5RWN7, 2026-09-12T07:32:18Z): doc half fixed by cipher at b41a26185; test half closes at solar's 2b599f12c (same commit as CPR-012) -- ack_clears_marker_via_existing_upsert now drives a real pending_ack_at->acknowledged_at upsert and observes the marker NULL, plus the existing runtime test herdr_queue_ephemeral::requires_ack_message_reminded_until_acked performs a real ack through the shipped CASE branch. No separate CPR-015 commit exists on review-3. Sha remap (fenix ATM 01M2A9NY2AEAKS6EAHY0V4ZDYB, 2026-09-12T07:52:59Z): review-3 rebased onto review-2 33754d69d (force-with-lease); test-half sha 2b599f12c -> c59d7c93b (same as CPR-012)." ;
